,"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-06-18T23:57:43Z","updated_at":"2025-07-03T17:27:47Z","closed_at":"2025-07-03T17:27:15Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in v4.5.beta.custom_build [46c495ca2]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta (46c495ca2) - macOS Sequoia (15.5.0) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Apple M4 Pro - Apple M4 Pro (14 threads) - 24.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe `Tween.tween_subtween()` method allows for a newly-created tween's execution to be suspended and placed as a step within another tween. As such, this tween (the subtween) can be killed with `Tween.kill()` before it has a chance to start executing (when its parent tween calls for it to start).\n\nDoing this leaves a rather cryptic error message in the Godot debugger and stops the parent tween's execution at the point where the killed subtween was.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f22d38c6-c66f-45ed-baec-38d73b047ed7)\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/07c0fa3b-82ef-40fc-8053-251d197c907c\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n```gdscript\n# Create the parent tween.\ntw = create_tween()\ntw.tween_property(icon, \"position:x\", 500, 1.0)\n\n# Create the subtween, then kill it.\nvar subtween = create_tween()\nsubtween.tween_property(icon, \"rotation_degrees\", 90, 1.0)\nsubtween.kill()\n\n# Attempt to add the subtween to the parent tween.\ntw.tween_subtween(subtween)\n\n# Perform a step in the tween after the subtween - it won't execute,\n# because the tweening engine stops at the killed subtween.\ntw.tween_property(icon, \"position:y\", 200, 1.0)\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test-subtween-valid_2025-06-18_16-57-15.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20805521/test-subtween-valid_2025-06-18_16-57-15.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107688/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107688/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}